    - target: {fileID: 5543133499646338922, guid: 7e21bcd968de0424e939f2ba3821b9cc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: scrollContent
      value: "Its countless legs crawl toward me...\n\nIf you carry the four gems,\nstand
        before the high place and link the lamp to the altar.\n\nYou may now enter
        paradise.\nBut on your way back\u2014do not forget this:\n\nBlue will stop
        it, for a moment. Simply lay it on the ground.\nThe others must strike it
        directly.\n\nYellow will confuse it sense.\nRed will slow it down.\nGreen
        will stun it briefly.\n\nGo with l.."
