      propertyPath: scrollContent
      value: "Leave the nest, and head toward the path where you must strive to grasp
        what lies ahead.\nThere, you shall return to the place where the first light
        was kindled.\n\nBut before that\u2026\nyou must find the final chamber.\n\nIf
