      propertyPath: scrollContent
      value: "Head into the long and narrow passage\u2026 then once more, turn left.\nThere,
        look up\u2014you will see the place you are trying to reach.\n\nBut you are
        not yet ready.\nBut for now, go to the small room just past the large hall.\nEnter
        it, and restore the balance.\n\nWhat dwells there has not yet awakened.\nYet
        if you fulfill your purpose\u2026\nit will chase you."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
