  m_text: "I sought the light... and placed it within the lamp.\nFrom the lamp, I
    could draw it forth\u2014hold it in my hand.\n\nNow, I must avoid the creature
    I once glimpsed.\n\nMay these not be my final words.\nReturn to the mouth of
    the cave.\nThe flames you lit along the way shall serve as your guide.\nLet memory
    be your compass.\n\nLet's face the final trial."
