    - target: {fileID: 5543133499646338922, guid: 7e21bcd968de0424e939f2ba3821b9cc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: scrollContent
      value: "Stranger drawn to the light...\nDo you know why No Color Land lost
        its light?\n\nWe were the village entrusted with the final light of the gods.\nBut
        an unknown creature came... and stole it away.\nNow we live in darkness,
        punished for our failure.\n\nMany have tried. All have failed.\nWill you
        be the one to save us?\n\nThis is your last chance to walk away.\n\nThe scroll
        you hold will serve as your guide\u2014a clue, a signpost on your path.\nThe
        gem is the key. With it, you may go where others could not.\n\n(PS. I leave
        this behind... in hopes of saving even one more soul.)"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
